fore | After\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"1050\" height=\"700\" alt=\"Screenshot_20251201_185900\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7d3e5bad-40a5-44a8-8b24-73ea9d665744\" /> | <img width=\"1050\" height=\"700\" alt=\"Screenshot_20251201_185819\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/260ea090-3a69-4b8d-bc9a-f90f3003c549\" />\r\n\r\n### List view\r\n\r\nBefore | After\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"1050\" height=\"700\" alt=\"Screenshot_20251201_185903\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ecb9ba95-9b87-432c-bbe9-01822197a9c5\" /> | <img width=\"1050\" height=\"700\" alt=\"Screenshot_20251201_185824\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/23ad9a8c-7a2c-4f5f-a40d-64b0cf6b339d\" />\r\n\r\n### Icons view (filter active)\r\n\r\nBefore | After\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"1050\" height=\"700\" alt=\"Screenshot_20251201_185906\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ac3957bc-82e1-45f1-94a2-d097f547c789\" /> | <img width=\"1050\" height=\"700\" alt=\"Screenshot_20251201_185834\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bcadc60c-76b2-4eb9-aab2-4f0b4f5f53a8\" />","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111212#pullrequestreview-3526354432","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111212","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-12-01T18:06:12Z"},{"id":3529503845,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7SX_Rl","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?u=2867ee7fcd920bc19b7d1cbf4b10264b9bbc9326&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","login":"bruvzg","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg"},"body":"Tested it and seems to be working fine, and looks good, but I ha